  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25616824",
      "title": "Using Programmatic (Imperative) Navigation",
      "sourceHash": "be572ef731199684c624aa5a4b98e12ac52fea5a4be8d7caf1a8c7534024bb89",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 4.33,
          "en": "Now, we've got that layout in place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.33,
          "end": 7.55,
          "en": "before we work on the actual data fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.55,
          "end": 9.57,
          "en": "and sending data to a backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.57,
          "end": 11.82,
          "en": "let's work on that detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.82,
          "end": 13.92,
          "en": "We've got that Show Details button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 16.223,
          "en": "but it's not doing anything right now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.14,
          "end": 21.5,
          "en": "Now the goal of course, is to load this meetup ID page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.5,
          "end": 23.04,
          "en": "this dynamic page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.04,
          "end": 26.54,
          "en": "whenever we click on a single meetup item to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.54,
          "end": 29.57,
          "en": "when we click on that show details button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.57,
          "end": 33.34,
          "en": "And therefore, we first of all need a link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.34,
          "end": 37.13,
          "en": "Now for this here on meetup item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.13,
          "end": 39.14,
          "en": "on this meetup item component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.14,
          "end": 41.33,
          "en": "we wanna create a link here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.33,
          "end": 45.23,
          "en": "And of course, we could do this with the link component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.23,
          "end": 47.67,
          "en": "and this would be the correct way of doing that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.67,
          "end": 50.33,
          "en": "since this would render an anchor tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.33,
          "end": 54.72,
          "en": "but to show you how you could navigate programmatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.72,
          "end": 57.13,
          "en": "something we will also need a later again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.13,
          "end": 59.76,
          "en": "when we submit a form and navigate a way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.76,
          "end": 61.6,
          "en": "to show you this alternative.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.6,
          "end": 63.42,
          "en": "I will stick to a button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.42,
          "end": 65.15,
          "en": "even though I will say that a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.15,
          "end": 67.16,
          "en": "would technically be a bit better,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.16,
          "end": 68.83,
          "en": "but we'll stick to this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.83,
          "end": 72.36,
          "en": "And instead, I want to create a function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.36,
          "end": 75.11,
          "en": "a function which will then navigate us away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.11,
          "end": 78.91,
          "en": "The Show Details handler, that could be the function name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.91,
          "end": 80.51,
          "en": "and now we connect this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.51,
          "end": 82.85,
          "en": "We wanna click prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.85,
          "end": 85.59,
          "en": "queue this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 85.59,
          "end": 87.02,
          "en": "and in the function we now want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.02,
          "end": 88.81,
          "en": "to navigate programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.81,
          "end": 91.32,
          "en": "And we can navigate programmatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.32,
          "end": 93.4,
          "en": "by using this, use router hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.4,
          "end": 96.22999999999999,
          "en": "which we saw earlier already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 96.22999999999999,
          "end": 99.87,
          "en": "So we can import, use router, again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 99.87,
          "end": 101.95,
          "en": "use router, from,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 101.95,
          "end": 104.78999999999999,
          "en": "next slash router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 104.78999999999999,
          "end": 108.18,
          "en": "and we can then call use router here in the component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 108.18,
          "end": 110.21000000000001,
          "en": "not in the show details handler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 110.21000000000001,
          "end": 113.82,
          "en": "it's a React hook and therefore the rules of hooks apply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.82,
          "end": 115.81,
          "en": "and we should only use React hooks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.81,
          "end": 119.57,
          "en": "directly at the root level of a component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.57,
          "end": 122.05,
          "en": "And hence here we call, use router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 122.05,
          "end": 124.12,
          "en": "get access to that router object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 124.12,
          "end": 125.98,
          "en": "and extend this router object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 125.98,
          "end": 128.42,
          "en": "which we can use in the show details handler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 128.42,
          "end": 130.8,
          "en": "to navigate programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 130.8,
          "end": 132.53,
          "en": "Because this router object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 132.53,
          "end": 135.49,
          "en": "does not just have the query property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 135.49,
          "end": 137.88,
          "en": "which gives us access to all that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 137.88,
          "end": 140.31,
          "en": "that might be part of the URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.31,
          "end": 142.96,
          "en": "for a dynamic page for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 142.96,
          "end": 145.41,
          "en": "but here we also have methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 145.41,
          "end": 148.28,
          "en": "for navigating programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 148.28,
          "end": 150.66,
          "en": "For example, the push method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 150.66,
          "end": 154.47,
          "en": "This pushes a new page onto the stack of pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 154.47,
          "end": 158.32999999999998,
          "en": "and it's the equivalent of using the link component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 158.32999999999998,
          "end": 159.79,
          "en": "if you don't want a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 159.79,
          "end": 162.87,
          "en": "but instead navigate programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 162.87,
          "end": 165.15,
          "en": "Push, therefore, also takes a path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 165.15,
          "end": 167.29,
          "en": "to which you want to navigate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 167.29,
          "end": 170.32999999999998,
          "en": "and here, that should be our meetup ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 170.32999999999998,
          "end": 173.368,
          "en": "because we have this meetup ID page here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 173.368,
          "end": 177.32999999999998,
          "en": "Now the meetup ID is something we get why via props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 177.32999999999998,
          "end": 179.62,
          "en": "because when we rendered that meetup list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 179.62,
          "end": 183.1,
          "en": "we passed the ID prop into the meetup item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 183.1,
          "end": 184.75,
          "en": "and therefore, instead of this meetup item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 184.75,
          "end": 189.583,
          "en": "we can now construct a dynamic path here by using props ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 191.01,
          "end": 192.92,
          "en": "So this will lead us to slash,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 192.92,
          "end": 196.9,
          "en": "and then the specific ID of this meetup item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 196.9,
          "end": 199.15,
          "en": "Again, here, programmatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 199.15,
          "end": 202.82999999999998,
          "en": "we could also render a link and construct the link path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 202.82999999999998,
          "end": 204.793,
          "en": "dynamically as an alternative.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 205.89,
          "end": 208.27,
          "en": "But with that, if we now save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 208.27,
          "end": 209.29,
          "en": "and we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 209.29,
          "end": 210.98,
          "en": "if I click show details,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 210.98,
          "end": 214.45,
          "en": "we get an error because we have no content for this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 214.45,
          "end": 217.92000000000002,
          "en": "but actually we see the URL was changed correctly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 217.92000000000002,
          "end": 219.65,
          "en": "and the only missing thing indeed now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 219.65,
          "end": 223.04,
          "en": "is the content on this meetup detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 223.04,
          "end": 225.59,
          "en": "And that's therefore, what we're going to add next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}